  "boundaryDecisions": [
    "Chosen StrongTaggedRcData profile traces actual same-heap RC data cells; hidden payload/C/code roots require separate admission",
    "Migrated carrier cohort is detached from legacy rc_head scanning; target registry and legacy scanner may not independently write the same physical cell",
    "Carrier identity and current collector allocation/queue/phase context differ; independent workers require extraction beyond address enumeration",
    "RootSeedPlan is frozen before termination accounting; seed workers stay active through actual trace and derived work publication",
    "Source reference census adds weak-table/bignum calls, generated mirrors and late-bound ABI, but does not establish dynamic whole-program closure",
    "Public request, combined operation, participant and private body scopes are distinct; resize child GC must inherit admission rather than reacquire the exclusive gate",
    "Legacy bool GC means overflow; Deferred/Rejected must never be false-success; pending request arguments/thunks remain actual roots",
    "G claim hands immutable plan through qualified delivery; sole C writer publishes one-shot completion with release, resolver acquires before fields and G registry/receipt publication",
    "ClosingTransfers honors already enrolled finalization and required GC; final entry seal waits unresolved transactions and future heap route/user cut",
    "Pending/unknown completion does not restore source ownership; real storage/root/VM/facility pins and held cut persist without assumed finite progress",
    "Modern C generation/opaque services/current queue helpers are credited; common LLVM and PSTATE decoupling benefits are not Zig-exclusive savings"
  ],
